1
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:20,359
Bro,

2
00:00:21,059 --> 00:00:22,559
I swear on the slammer, I'm begging you.

3
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:24,399
Enough already.

4
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,119
The slammer.

5
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,979
You really don't get it anymore...

6
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,219
Bro...

7
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,380
Bro, I tried my best.

8
00:00:49,299 --> 00:00:50,200
I really couldn't hold him back.

9
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,560
Bro, I let you down.

10
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:01,460
So you're Zhang Haoran, huh?

11
00:01:05,219 --> 00:01:05,939
Old He,

12
00:01:10,379 --> 00:01:12,140
your daughter sure came in handy!

13
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,359
Bro! Bro! Bro!

14
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:20,659
You can't take him! Bro, bro!

15
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,680
You can't take him, Bro!

16
00:01:24,079 --> 00:01:25,280
I did this willingly.

17
00:01:47,379 --> 00:01:48,099
Just kidding.

18
00:01:48,140 --> 00:01:49,319
Why take it so seriously?

19
00:01:58,060 --> 00:01:59,459
As if I'd dare take on Brother He.

20
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:04,019
Years back, Brother He ran this town.

21
00:02:05,879 --> 00:02:07,480
I was just a little punk back then.

22
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,180
Right, Boss He?

23
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,860
Nobody called me "boss" back then.

24
00:02:17,139 --> 00:02:18,759
Cut the bullshit with me.

25
00:02:23,080 --> 00:02:24,580
This girl's great in every way,

26
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,900
except she's got a fierce temper.

27
00:02:30,099 --> 00:02:31,460
Look how hard she bit me.

28
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,180
What now?

29
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,340
This is the big boss!

30
00:02:46,419 --> 00:02:47,659
Where are your damn manners?

31
00:02:49,379 --> 00:02:49,939
Brother He,

32
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,879
let me teach her a lesson for you.

33
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,379
Get the hell out!

34
00:03:35,879 --> 00:03:36,379
Brother He,

35
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,219
dropping in on me out of nowhere,

36
00:03:38,379 --> 00:03:39,599
what are you really after?

37
00:03:43,879 --> 00:03:44,520
Honestly,

38
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:47,360
nothing at all.

39
00:03:50,759 --> 00:03:52,759
Songliao has two big bosses.

40
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,039
Couldn't find one,

41
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,180
but I found you.

42
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:02,539
Just trying to get a bite to eat.

43
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:15,599
Brother He,

44
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:18,180
I was away the past couple of days.

45
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,860
My boys didn't know any better,

46
00:04:20,740 --> 00:04:21,660
and they didn't treat you right.

47
00:04:22,959 --> 00:04:23,560
From here on out,

48
00:04:24,379 --> 00:04:25,220
I'll take care of you myself.

49
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,620
Good.

50
00:04:59,399 --> 00:04:59,899
Bro.

51
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,279
I'm sorry.

52
00:05:03,939 --> 00:05:05,519
I couldn't protect our home.

53
00:05:14,259 --> 00:05:15,000
Hurts, doesn't it?

54
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,420
You've been through a lot.

55
00:05:22,220 --> 00:05:23,360
I have a use for this guy.

56
00:05:24,620 --> 00:05:25,279
Wait for me.

57
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:27,920
I'll let you kill him with your own hands.

58
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,519
In the early 1980s,

59
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:57,639
being a factory worker

60
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,180
meant you could hold your head high anywhere

61
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:01,519
with genuine pride.

62
00:06:01,660 --> 00:06:02,779
But those of us

63
00:06:02,779 --> 00:06:04,379
who stayed in the factory every day

64
00:06:04,379 --> 00:06:05,060
didn't realize

65
00:06:05,259 --> 00:06:07,959
that times were slowly changing outside.

66
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,800
The spring breeze of reform sweeps the land!

67
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:11,339
We must actively answer the call

68
00:06:11,579 --> 00:06:13,040
and embrace the market economy!

69
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,120
Aspiring people from all walks of life

70
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:17,319
must bravely go into business and blaze new trails!

71
00:06:17,879 --> 00:06:19,259
It is glorious to get rich through hard work!

72
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:20,959
Change your fate through struggle!

73
00:06:21,639 --> 00:06:22,779
Work hard across all trades

74
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,399
to contribute to socialist modernization!

75
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:27,379
Dear listeners...

76
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:29,459
You're not really planning to quit, are you?

77
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,120
What's the point of staying?

78
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,000
I'm gonna be a boss lady!

79
00:06:37,399 --> 00:06:38,279
Well, I think

80
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:40,660
you've definitely been

81
00:06:40,959 --> 00:06:42,680
bewitched by that Brother Biao.

82
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:45,540
You're even giving up your iron rice bowl!

83
00:06:46,259 --> 00:06:46,939
Zhou Meng,

84
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:49,000
staying in this factory has made you dumb.

85
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:51,459
Do you know dancing at Brother Biao's hall,

86
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:53,500
just two hours a night,

87
00:06:53,860 --> 00:06:55,079
pays two whole yuan?

88
00:06:55,860 --> 00:06:56,600
Aren't you jealous?

89
00:06:58,379 --> 00:06:58,959
Not at all.

90
00:06:59,819 --> 00:07:01,639
I drive my truck and collect my pay.

91
00:07:02,139 --> 00:07:03,339
It's good and steady.

92
00:07:11,480 --> 00:07:12,500
Xiuer, come over here.

93
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:14,060
I'm sorting through clothes.

94
00:07:16,079 --> 00:07:17,259
Come try this on. It's freezing out.

95
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:21,879
Check this out.

96
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:23,939
This looks nice.

97
00:07:24,319 --> 00:07:24,779
Try it on.

98
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:27,160
Fits just right.

99
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,360
The size is perfect too.

100
00:07:29,100 --> 00:07:29,579
Thanks.

101
00:07:30,699 --> 00:07:31,360
By the way, Mengmeng.

102
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,399
Vice Director Ma said earlier...

103
00:07:33,660 --> 00:07:35,060
...to go see him at the garage.

104
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:35,959
Right now.

105
00:07:37,139 --> 00:07:37,740
Right now?

106
00:07:38,860 --> 00:07:40,120
I'm not scheduled to drive today.

107
00:07:40,439 --> 00:07:41,860
Doesn't sound like driving duty.

108
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:43,759
Word is...

109
00:07:44,339 --> 00:07:45,279
...he wants you on a business trip with him.

110
00:07:49,899 --> 00:07:52,420
No wonder she looks down on our petty business.

111
00:07:53,259 --> 00:07:54,399
Turns out our Zhou Meng...

112
00:07:54,839 --> 00:07:56,500
...has big shots,

113
00:07:56,899 --> 00:07:57,759
big business,

114
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,240
and a grand future to chase.

115
00:08:00,959 --> 00:08:02,240
What's that supposed to mean?

116
00:08:02,899 --> 00:08:04,180
A man and a woman traveling alone together?

117
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:05,819
They can do whatever the hell they want.

118
00:08:07,079 --> 00:08:08,120
Gee, thanks a lot.

119
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:10,160
I was a fool to worry about you.

120
00:08:11,579 --> 00:08:12,740
Ignore her. Just ignore her.

121
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:13,899
Seriously...

122
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:17,480
Director Ma.

123
00:08:19,259 --> 00:08:20,019
Director Ma.

124
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,120
Zhou Meng.

125
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,220
Get in. Let's talk inside.

126
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,879
I'll pass.

127
00:08:28,079 --> 00:08:29,180
It's cramped in there.

128
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:31,500
If something's up, step out and tell me.

129
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:35,039
I'm not on the schedule today.

130
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,580
What's so urgent you had to tell me in person?

131
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:44,159
It's not hard labor like hauling cargo.

132
00:08:45,039 --> 00:08:45,799
It's for me, personally.

133
00:08:46,379 --> 00:08:47,379
I'm heading to Harbin.

134
00:08:48,179 --> 00:08:49,080
I need an assistant...

135
00:08:49,700 --> 00:08:50,820
...to handle the paperwork...

136
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,899
...and foster some closeness.

137
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:54,220
Wait, no.

138
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,919
I mean, coordinate some business.

139
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:59,179
Isn't that a job for the factory office?

140
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:01,240
So you know it's the factory office!

141
00:09:02,019 --> 00:09:03,440
Isn't this your big chance?

142
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:04,840
Zhou Meng.

143
00:09:05,419 --> 00:09:06,360
A woman...

144
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,200
...is just like a car.

145
00:09:10,639 --> 00:09:11,080
You see...

146
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:12,600
When a car is brand-new...

147
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,340
...it's all shiny and sleek.

148
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,559
Smooth as silk to the touch.

149
00:09:17,019 --> 00:09:18,259
But over time...

150
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:20,100
...running through wind and rain...

151
00:09:20,659 --> 00:09:21,620
...no matter how new it was...

152
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,960
...it gets worn to pieces.

153
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,379
So what I'll do...

154
00:09:27,259 --> 00:09:27,860
...is pull some strings...

155
00:09:28,879 --> 00:09:30,419
...and move you to the factory office.

156
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,179
You can sit in a nice office.

157
00:09:33,580 --> 00:09:34,059
Right?

158
00:09:34,860 --> 00:09:35,620
There...

159
00:09:36,379 --> 00:09:37,980
...you're sheltered from the elements.

160
00:09:38,539 --> 00:09:38,980
That...

161
00:09:40,659 --> 00:09:42,460
...is where a woman belongs.

162
00:09:44,679 --> 00:09:45,320
I'm not going.

163
00:09:45,759 --> 00:09:46,639
I'm a driver.

164
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,480
The garage is my post.

165
00:09:48,659 --> 00:09:49,320
I'm not going anywhere.

166
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:52,259
Then you're disobeying your superior.

167
00:09:53,820 --> 00:09:54,820
A superior's orders...

168
00:09:55,240 --> 00:09:57,139
...should respect the worker's wishes.

169
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,899
I don't have the skills for it.

170
00:09:59,179 --> 00:09:59,919
I can't do it.

171
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:01,639
What kind of talk is that?

172
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,700
"Revolutionary comrades are like bricks—

173
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,759
moved wherever they are needed."

174
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:09,480
You're a driver,

175
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:12,179
but above all, you're my worker.

176
00:10:13,220 --> 00:10:14,820
You must follow the organization's orders.

177
00:10:15,500 --> 00:10:16,059
Submit...

178
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:17,679
...to my authority.

179
00:10:19,019 --> 00:10:19,919
Vice Director Ma.

180
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,100
If you want to talk, just talk.

181
00:10:21,139 --> 00:10:22,080
Quit circling around me,

182
00:10:22,179 --> 00:10:23,740
and keep your damn hands to yourself!

183
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,659
I'll follow proper work duties.

184
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:28,740
If it's a real trip to Beijing, I'm game.

185
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:30,960
Then I can ask the old director...

186
00:10:31,179 --> 00:10:32,200
...if leaders in our factory...

187
00:10:32,340 --> 00:10:34,500
...can just make up whatever rules they want.

188
00:10:35,039 --> 00:10:35,779
I've got things to do.

189
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:37,059
We're done talking.

190
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,899
So you won't do this the easy way, huh?

191
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:55,360
Zhou Meng.

192
00:10:55,740 --> 00:10:56,539
Ma Limin, what are you doing?

193
00:10:56,879 --> 00:10:57,899
This is the women's locker room.

194
00:10:58,799 --> 00:10:59,360
You two, get out.

195
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:00,360
Get out and shut the door!

196
00:11:04,379 --> 00:11:05,120
What are you doing?

197
00:11:05,639 --> 00:11:06,759
Zhou Meng, have I been too nice to you?

198
00:11:07,700 --> 00:11:08,600
I treat you like one of my own.

199
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:09,840
I gave you this opportunity.

200
00:11:10,419 --> 00:11:11,100
If you're with me,

201
00:11:11,159 --> 00:11:12,360
what couldn't you have in this factory?

202
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,580
It's the reform era now.

203
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:16,340
I'm single, you're unmarried.

204
00:11:16,879 --> 00:11:17,879
It's just what men and women do.

205
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,000
What are you so shy about?

206
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,299
Are you done yet?!

207
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,240
Zhou Meng, stop playing innocent!

208
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,059
Just be with me— What are you doing?!

209
00:11:24,299 --> 00:11:25,299
Just be with me— Let go of me!

210
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,379
Just be with me, Zhou Meng!

211
00:11:26,399 --> 00:11:27,820
Listen to me, just be with me and—

212
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:29,019
Ma Limin!

213
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:30,879
If you won't show some self-respect, I'll teach you!

214
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:37,059
You bitch, you hit me?!

215
00:11:37,500 --> 00:11:38,100
Stop right there!

216
00:11:38,740 --> 00:11:39,259
Stand right there!

217
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:42,860
Haizhu!

218
00:11:44,139 --> 00:11:44,700
Stop right there!

219
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:49,940
What happened?

220
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,000
What's his deal?

221
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:54,899
Director Ma!

222
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,440
Where did he just come from?

223
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,960
He really treats this place like home, huh?

224
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:00,559
He came out of the women's locker room.

225
00:12:01,500 --> 00:12:02,080
Liu Haizhu!

226
00:12:03,460 --> 00:12:04,159
Just the man I was looking for.

227
00:12:05,460 --> 00:12:07,299
About the police hauling you away,

228
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,159
what's the story on that?

229
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:10,340
A serious street brawl, wasn't it?

230
00:12:11,259 --> 00:12:12,320
The factory will have to discipline you properly.

231
00:12:13,379 --> 00:12:14,700
Wait, the police let me go!

232
00:12:14,799 --> 00:12:15,779
That proves I'm in the clear.

233
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:17,299
If there's nothing, what's there to report to you?

234
00:12:17,500 --> 00:12:19,500
Then I've got nothing to report about work today either.

235
00:12:19,879 --> 00:12:20,639
I'm a technician.

236
00:12:20,779 --> 00:12:22,059
Even if I reported it, you wouldn't understand anyway.

237
00:12:22,419 --> 00:12:22,779
Liu Haizhu!

238
00:12:22,860 --> 00:12:24,519
You really are asking for trouble!

239
00:12:25,899 --> 00:12:27,779
Believe me, I'll give you a major demerit right now!

240
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:29,340
A major demerit?

241
00:12:29,620 --> 00:12:30,259
On what grounds?

242
00:12:30,340 --> 00:12:31,059
What did I do?

243
00:12:31,519 --> 00:12:32,279
On what grounds?

244
00:12:33,159 --> 00:12:34,580
Because I'm the deputy director!

245
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:36,500
Because of all the trouble you've caused!

246
00:12:36,559 --> 00:12:37,399
I have full authority over you!

247
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,039
You skipped work,

248
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,940
incited workers against leadership,

249
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,220
formed cliques,

250
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,500
and got into brawls!

251
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:44,419
Tell me,

252
00:12:45,139 --> 00:12:46,159
which one of these things

253
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,639
is something a decent worker should be doing?!

254
00:12:48,539 --> 00:12:49,159
And as for you two,

255
00:12:49,860 --> 00:12:50,879
clinging to each other every day,

256
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:52,480
fooling around inappropriately!

257
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:53,639
Add all that together,

258
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:55,220
and I have more than enough reason to fire you!

259
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:57,720
Liu Haizhu is my partner!

260
00:13:00,799 --> 00:13:01,539
Did you hear that?

261
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,940
We ARE in a relationship!

262
00:13:04,379 --> 00:13:05,559
Proudly out in the open, too!

263
00:13:05,879 --> 00:13:07,039
What business is it of yours?!

264
00:13:07,500 --> 00:13:08,059
Stop right there!

265
00:13:08,799 --> 00:13:09,700
Did I say you two could leave?!

266
00:13:13,340 --> 00:13:15,220
Wait, what do you want?

267
00:13:16,379 --> 00:13:17,559
Can't we go do our jobs?

268
00:13:17,779 --> 00:13:18,899
You won't let us work,

269
00:13:19,019 --> 00:13:20,139
you won't let us date.

270
00:13:20,259 --> 00:13:21,620
Seriously, what kind of director are you?

271
00:13:21,879 --> 00:13:22,639
Barging in everywhere,

272
00:13:22,679 --> 00:13:23,799
poking your nose into everything!

273
00:13:23,879 --> 00:13:24,360
Exactly!

274
00:13:24,460 --> 00:13:25,240
I even saw him just now,

275
00:13:25,299 --> 00:13:26,340
coming out of the women's locker room!

276
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,679
What were you doing in the women's locker room?!

277
00:13:27,860 --> 00:13:28,240
Fine!

278
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:30,200
You want to lecture me on rules, huh?

279
00:13:30,659 --> 00:13:32,399
Then we'll go strictly by factory regulations!

280
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:35,320
Given your long history of unruly behavior,

281
00:13:35,820 --> 00:13:36,759
once you get back,

282
00:13:37,419 --> 00:13:39,659
for your undisciplined and insubordinate conduct,

283
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,559
you will write me a thorough self-criticism!

284
00:13:42,539 --> 00:13:43,960
No fewer than 3,000 words!

285
00:13:44,879 --> 00:13:46,440
Dig deep into the root of your mindset,

286
00:13:46,740 --> 00:13:47,580
and reflect properly!

287
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,779
When the factory-wide assembly comes,

288
00:13:50,399 --> 00:13:52,220
I'll set aside dedicated time for you

289
00:13:52,539 --> 00:13:53,399
to go up there,

290
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,220
in front of all the factory workers,

291
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:56,460
and read it out loud!

292
00:13:57,419 --> 00:13:58,960
Man, your rank isn't that high,

293
00:13:59,059 --> 00:14:01,019
but you sure throw your weight around!

294
00:14:02,259 --> 00:14:02,940
Right?

295
00:14:03,059 --> 00:14:04,279
Demanding a self-criticism, really?

296
00:14:04,799 --> 00:14:05,580
What are you all muttering about?!

297
00:14:07,159 --> 00:14:08,519
Who else wants a major demerit with him?!

298
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:08,919
Come on!

299
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,639
Come on, step forward!

300
00:14:10,399 --> 00:14:11,179
Step out and let me see you!

301
00:14:13,259 --> 00:14:14,120
Did you get that?!

302
00:14:15,019 --> 00:14:16,480
You're not getting a 3,000-word self-criticism.

303
00:14:17,159 --> 00:14:17,759
Just two words:

304
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,039
Piss off.

305
00:14:21,559 --> 00:14:22,019
Let's go.

306
00:14:23,460 --> 00:14:24,059
Liu Haizhu!

307
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:24,820
*Spits*

308
00:14:25,580 --> 00:14:27,039
Liu Haizhu, you've got some nerve!

309
00:14:27,940 --> 00:14:30,120
Sooner or later, I'll strip you of that uniform!

310
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:31,720
Then you won't be jack shit!

311
00:14:34,139 --> 00:14:34,820
What are you all staring at?!

312
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:36,620
Get back to work!
